that I kind of came here.

00:03:10.908 --> 00:03:13.810
Really felt the energy, felt
like the world was shifting.

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:16.016
Felt the Internet was going into a very,

00:03:16.016 --> 00:03:19.435
