00:06:48.827 --> 00:06:49.751
- Great.

00:06:49.751 --> 00:06:52.212
- [Voiceover] So the first
time I hear the word empathy

00:06:52.212 --> 00:06:54.008
in a business context it was from you.

00:06:54.008 --> 00:06:54.743
- OK.

00:06:54.743 --> 00:06:56.648
- [Voiceover] And it really such a big

00:06:56.648 --> 00:06:58.855
